From: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 10:05:18 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Docs/admin-guide/mm/damon/usage: add avail_types file under
 damos filter dir

Signed-off-by: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
